  "project_description": "This module provides the ability to add metatags for webforms.\n\n Installation \n \n Install module composer require drupal/metatag_webform \n Enable the \"Metatag Webform\" module in \"Extend\" \n Navigate to \"/admin/structure/webform\" and click \"Build\" on the webform you want add metatags for \n Go to \"Settings\" primary tab, then \"Metatags\" secondary tab \n Add metatags for the webform and click \"Save\" \n Rebuild site's cache",
